                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhani Aroni mvi Eleazari ma mvi Finehasi oja adra mani anzi Israelini ma ruaarisi ra, erini ovule a’yaru a’ya manisi yi ma eseliarisi, mani ani anzi Israelini ma dri jazu a’ya manisi ku beni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
